<title>USA: Metrowerks Inc Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>Metrowerks Inc Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metrowerks Inc.</p>
<p>				  Financial Highlights</p>
<p>			    Jul 31  Oct. 31  Jan 31  Apr 30  Jul 31</p>
<p>				1995    1995    1996    1996     1996</p>
<p> Revenue		  $1,808  $2,325  $2,418  $2,372   $3,504</p>
